§ Jesse = "I possess"
son of Boaz and the father of king David

H3449.definition:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 1Ch.23.20;
son of: Uzziel (H5816);
brother of: Mishael (H4332), Elizaphan (H0469), Sithri (H5644) and Micah (H4318J);
father of: Zechariah (H2148E)
